:: j3 [j3 shin-gobee-desert map]
<div class='flex-row flex items-center gap-lg'>
  <div class='explore-box'>
    <p>It's really hot out here. Unless you have some water, you might want to come back later.</p>
    <h3>EXPLORE</h3>
    <ul class='choices'>
      <li>[[Look around->j3: description]]</li>
      <li>[[Observe some interesting plants.->j3: funny looking plants]]</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
  <<map 'j3'>><<n>><<w>><<s>><</map>><<set $players[$activePlayer].characters[$activeCharacter].worldMapPosition = 'j3'>>
</div>